# Ignore local .claude/ state, but ship CLAUDE.md into the build (the brain
# code agent reads it at /app/.claude/CLAUDE.md). The explicit re-include for
# .claude/CLAUDE.md lives at the END of this file so it wins over the broad
# "CLAUDE.md" rule below (git uses the last matching pattern).
