# Must be LAST so it wins over the broad "CLAUDE.md" rule above: the brain
# Dockerfile COPYs .claude/ into the image and the code agent reads
# /app/.claude/CLAUDE.md, so it must exist in a fresh git clone's build context.
!.claude/CLAUDE.md